    {
      "text": "A line chart titled \"EPI: Temperature alarms - last 12 months\" for Trainingland, November 2015 to October 2016, with two series. Cold chain low temperature alarms (green): 35, 31, 34, 34, 42, 29, 34, 28, 41, 34, 43, 30. Cold chain high temperature alarms (blue) run slightly lower, between 23 and about 38, and meet the low-alarm line at about 30 in October 2016.",
